        "conclusion": "Two historical model years show sampled blocking persistence as well as mean visibility. Existing terrain/image support remains consistent, but reference-point geometry cannot establish component power, working links, buildable soil or qualified continuous darkness."
      },
      {
        "stage": "subject_polar_thermal",
