        "findings_sha256": "5f9d82c6e71c2100f6b41c8af6f400b6fd3773be753fb01f76e0a914c44c487b",
        "conclusion": "Spatial/model thermal tails, mesh support and ice-stability context are available. Unlike depth/statistics, unvalidated footprints and absent chronological response prevent component thermal or resource-operability conclusions."
      },
      {
        "stage": "subject_radiation_time",
