        "findings_sha256": "2f08a9082a0071b76d444c21eb52642a2a9d0c8a66174f71b39c4b037274ff79",
        "conclusion": "Calendar support and observed upper tails reveal what averages hide. Orbital counters, Earth-orbit space-weather flux and solar associations cannot certify local shielded exposure, event recurrence or a safe arrival season."
      },
      {
        "stage": "subject_plasma",
